WEBVTT

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:39.490
Seconds!

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:42.970
Really, you should go get ready or you won't be on time.

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:47.450
The third semester just started and you're already being late...

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:52.100
Don't worry. Kobayashi Issa once said,

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.590
you can't create poems on an empty stomach.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.200
It's "can't fight wars".

00:01:56.200 --> 00:02:00.100
If you keep eating, you're just going to become more dull-witted.

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:00.890
Stop it already.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.900
My brain isn't in such bad shape.

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.480
So, give me seconds!

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:09.270
This will be the last one, okay?

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:12.700
I've got to make sure that I eat a full breakfast.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:16.160
Yes, I'll have two or three more helpings.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:17.190
Here, give it to me.

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:19.820
Hurry up and get ready after you finish your natto.

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:34.730
Haruka! Haruka!

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:35.420
Good morning!

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:38.960
Good morning, Atsuko, Maki.

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:40.480
Morning.

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:42.220
It's rare for you to be this late.

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:44.760
Did you sleep in because you haven't adjusted from the winter holidays?

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.180
That's not it.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.310
It's because Kana was taking her time...

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:51.020
It's such a tough job being a mother.

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:56.790
How was your winter holiday?

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:59.170
How it was, well...

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.650
Oh, we all went to a hot spring.

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:03.240
Eh? Hot spring?

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:04.840
Yup.

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:06.950
It was great.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.010
What about you, Atsuko?

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:17.420
I went with my parents to visit my grandfather.

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:19.470
Hawaii? Australia?

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.540
What makes you think it's overseas?

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:29.770
Well, on New Year's Day, normally you'd just stay home and eat New Year dishes, and idle your time away, right?

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:35.340
Just once, I'd like to experience
New Year's Day in another country.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.940
But we aren't good at English...

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:42.070
I've never thought about taking a trip overseas.

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:50.930
Break's just ended, so there'll be a lot to do...

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:54.040
Who wants to take on the role of class representative?

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:59.960
Actually, the class rep is sick. In the worst case, he might have to be hospitalized for a long time.

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:02.870
I hope it's nothing too serious.

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:03.320
So, does anyone want to take the role?
I hope it's nothing too serious.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:04.570
Hope so.
So, does anyone want to take the role?

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:05.600
So, does anyone want to take the role?

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.820
Haruka, give it a try.

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:09.770
Eh? Why me?!

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:12.990
Oh, Minami-san. Are you willing to do it?

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:15.860
Uh, no, I don't think I...

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:18.190
Just do it, Haruka!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:21.250
I think you're very suitable for the position of class rep.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:22.670
Maki!

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:25.620
Really? In that case, Minami-san, we'll be counting on you.

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:28.030
N–No way!

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:33.540
Now you've done it, Maki.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.030
Sorry, sorry. I didn't really mean to...

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.910
You should have taken the job.

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:43.460
No way, a class rep has to do all kinds of things, and I'll end up getting home late...

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:45.270
That's true.

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:47.930
I think Haruka can do it.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:51.150
A super housewife, who can handle both her job and housework!

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:53.480
I don't want to be someone like that...

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:57.270
Well, in any case, you have until the weekend to decide.

00:04:58.050 --> 00:05:00.100
But it's really too bad.

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:04.040
I heard Haruka was a banchou during middle school.

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:09.110
Who told you such a thing...

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:12.600
Haruka was actually a banchou?

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:14.290
No, I wasn't!

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.270
But, according to the Legend of the Banchou–

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:18.380
Eh? What? What? Tell me! Tell me!

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:23.020
Well, I recall she was called out by the boys from her school–

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:23.380
And then?

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:24.660
And then?

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:28.920
She defeated them one after another. In the end, she took them in as underlings.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:34.150
That never happened! More strange rumors are going to follow me now...

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:37.000
Eh? You're awesome, Haruka.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.480
Eh? My milk...

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:45.110
It's all wrong.  Those are just rumors. Don't tell them to other people!

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:48.950
I think a lot of people probably already know about it.

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:51.100
Ehhhh...

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:01.520
What is this?

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:02.750
What?

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:04.760
It's a hamster.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:09.300
No, I can tell that by looking. I mean why is it in the classroom?

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:13.730
I heard our teacher brought it back after a visit to her parents' home.

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:16.190
Looks like the whole class will be responsible for feeding it.

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:18.050
This is what they call "education of sentiment", huh...

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:21.200
What's this education thing you mentioned?

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:24.960
It's a form of teaching that's meant to endow good values and emotional intelligence.

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:26.260
Endow?

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:37.160
What? What were you trying to say, jerk?

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:41.420
What's wrong? Is it hungry?

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:43.040
No, this is...

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:44.630
I'm going to feed him!

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:48.180
Here, eat up!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.420
Stop it!

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:52.490
Why a pencil?

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:55.110
My mom used to scold me when I bit the end of a pencil,

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:58.810
saying "Don't do something a mouse would do".

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.600
That's wrong! Pencils aren't food.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.100
Even if you say that...

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:04.950
Every one of you is the same...

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:08.510
Listen up. How you take care of it is very important.

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:12.130
If you make a mistake, it's going to lead to big trouble in the future.

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:15.860
First of all, its living environment.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:18.580
If you let it live in a messy, filthy place,

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:21.670
then it won't grow up healthily.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:22.790
Next is feeding.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:25.540
It will eat as much as you give it.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.070
Just like an idiot.

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:29.800
So the one feeding it must regulate the portions of food.

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:33.640
No matter how much it wants it, you can't give in.

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:36.290
Only give it the appropriate amount.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:39.540
If it doesn't behave, then you'll have to discipline it.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.600
Understood?

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.060
Then, what do we do?

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.530
Just leaving it in a cardboard box is not enough.

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:48.650
Uchida, get me a bowl.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:49.820
From where?

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.520
Uchida, this is the princess's order!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:59.830
You go and get me some vegetable leaves from the lunchroom.

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:01.070
Why?

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:03.170
As you wish!

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:08.400
What remains is...

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:14.090
Hey, Chiaki.
Can you lend me your math textbook?

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:18.020
Touma, get me some water with those paint cans.

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:19.060
Huh? Why?

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:20.980
It's the princess's order.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.790
Your servants have all gone to their tasks.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:28.810
Please be patient, princess.

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:31.530
Um, can you stop calling me princess?

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:11.180
Because of this, I want to appoint a person to take care of the hamster.

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:12.660
Who do you guys believe is the most appropriate?

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:26.010
Eh? Chiaki's responsible for taking care of it?

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:29.510
I would never have thought you'd take this kind of job.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:32.060
It's not like I wanted to do it.

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:33.980
They just suddenly left it to me.

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:35.860
Can you handle it?

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:40.360
With regard to dealing with animals,
I think I've had some level of experience.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.670
D–Don't stare at me like that.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.650
Did your brain stop working, you idiot?

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:51.680
What did you say?!

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:53.050
All right, all right...

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:55.830
Everyone is placing their faith in you, so do your best.

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:56.090
Yes, Haruka-neesama.

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:57.250
Seconds!
Yes, Haruka-neesama.

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:57.260
Seconds!

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:03.800
By the way, Chiaki.
Do you know how to take care of hamsters?

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:05.560
Yes, more or less.

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:07.140
I've read books about it.

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:09.590
You must teach it how to perform some tricks.

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:10.970
Tricks?

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.310
Like jumping through flaming hoops, or balancing on a ball.

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:14.910
This is a hamster, you know.

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:16.230
It can't do them?

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:18.720
Then what about shaking hands or begging?

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.600
I–It can do those?

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:22.340
How will you feed it?

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:27.060
I can get food from the cafeteria.
Also, everyone will be bringing vegetables.

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:33.640
Haruka-neesama, a hamster's favorite food are carrots.

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:35.370
That's fine. You can have some.

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:40.210
Also, spinach has a very high nutritional value to hamsters.

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:44.370
No problem. I'll keep your portion for you, too.

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:57.640
Your great sister's pose!

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:59.280
Yeah, that's right.

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:01.840
Then, with all due respect, I shall refer to you as,

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.960
"Big Idiot".

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:13.960
Is that so?

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:15.810
I completely didn't know.

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:16.900
Really?

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:21.370
Eh? About <i>that</i>?

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:24.090
It's no good. After all, I've got the girls here.

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:29.260
I can't accept it. There's just no way.

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:31.420
What's she talking about?

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:32.790
Who knows.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.230
Hurry up, Kana!

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:45.040
You always wait till the last minute...

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:46.070
Wait up!

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:49.420
Starting tomorrow, there won't be breakfast for you.

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:52.000
Then you won't be in such a fluster when you leave every morning.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.980
You've got to be kidding! Then you can come to hell with me!

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:56.950
I don't mind.

00:12:00.390 --> 00:12:01.870
Come now, let's go.

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:15.080
Kana, what's wrong?

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:19.680
I'm wondering if there's a way to finish my breakfast within three minutes.

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:21.800
What's that about?

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:24.710
Ah, there she is. The former banchou's little sister.

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:29.360
Hey, hey, I have something I want to ask you. Are you in the middle of something?

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.270
You mean Kana?

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:33.450
I don't think she's really doing anything.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:36.460
That's enough. Let's go back.

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:37.780
What're you saying?

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:40.420
You're the third generation inheritor of Minami Haruka's title,

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:42.650
so it's got something to do with you, doesn't it?

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:46.620
Hey, is it true that the legendary banchou, Minami Haruka, is making a comeback?

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.210
I told you I didn't inherit it.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:54.730
The one who left countless legends and disappeared without a trace, the extraordinary, Minami Haruka!

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:56.180
That's just because she's gone to high school.

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.540
But, no one thinks it'll just end just that.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:01.780
One day, Minami Haruka will make a comeback.

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:05.080
It's because of this strong belief that the title of banchou is passed down generations!

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:08.150
And finally, the day of her revival has come.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:13.650
In response to the wishes of everyone, the legendary banchou Minami Haruka returns!

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:17.810
It seems that you really like Haruka-san.

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:20.660
By the way, that is my juice.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:25.400
I'm only a spectator. Spectator Hiroko.

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:27.400
I'm just a little interested.

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:31.020
Yummy.

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:32.370
She actually drank it...

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:35.130
So have you heard anything from your sister?

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:37.050
That kind of thing, I have never...

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:41.520
I can't accept it. There's just no way.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:46.360
So that's how it is. That call was about this matter.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.590
Eh? What? What?

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:49.980
Although I don't have hard evidence, there was a sign.

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:51.100
So it's true!

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.840
Is that for real?

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:53.660
Yeah.

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:59.600
Last night, during dinner, she told Chiaki that she should work hard since everyone was placing their faith in her.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:03.480
Now that I think about it, it seemed like something she wanted to say to herself.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:05.530
And then she said "Seconds"!

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.250
Seconds?

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:10.090
If that is the case, then we can't waste any more time here.

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:10.990
Why?

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:14.780
In the past, this school was dominated by Minami Haruka.

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:17.840
So the role of Chief of the Banchou Alliance should be given to Minami!

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:20.000
Banchou Alliance?!

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:20.940
What's that?

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:23.330
Because the legendary banchou is making a comeback.

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:26.650
Needless to say, the banchou groups of the high school and middle school in the area,

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:30.840
including the motorcycle gangs, cheer squads, and leaders of various sports groups,

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:34.480
will all unite under the flag of the Great Banchou, Minami Haruka!

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.290
Great! That's awesome! I'll join!

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:39.800
We'll start with this school!

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:42.410
This place shall become an important part of our forces!

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.960
Minami, what was it you wanted to talk abou...

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:52.380
We've been waiting, banchou!

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:55.200
Who's... a banchou?

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.470
You, that's who!

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:58.590
I–I'm... a banchou?

00:14:59.030 --> 00:15:00.940
What a pitiful guy.

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:03.290
Don't you even have the common sense of a banchou?

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:05.270
Even if you say that...

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:06.570
"I'm a banchou!"

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:07.520
Try to say it like that!

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.220
Why?

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.530
Yell it!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:14.300
I'm a banchou!

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:19.780
Good. From now on, you will become the
Great Banchou Minami Haruka's right-hand banchou.

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:26.610
Uh... I still don't quite understand. What should a banchou be doing?

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:28.360
Wait.

00:15:33.270 --> 00:15:33.960
Okay.

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:41.340
You should know what to do now that you've come here, right?

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:42.970
No, I still don't quite get it...

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.780
Smash all the windows here!

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:48.250
I... I can't do such a thing!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:50.210
The first generation banchou has already done it!

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:52.690
How can the fourth generation not be able to do it?!

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:54.480
Is there even a meaning in doing that?

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:56.100
I don't know!

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:58.650
Hey, can I say something?

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:03.690
I'm quite sure it wasn't that she smashed all the windows,

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:05.630
but rather, she wiped all of them sparkling clean.

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:07.510
So it seems!

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:10.330
Hurry up and wipe all the windows sparkling clean!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:18.190
What do you think? Don't you feel you're a step closer to the legendary banchou?

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:19.920
Um, not at all.

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:21.630
I agree!

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:27.440
Fujioka, you piece of junk!

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:29.760
You stupid, slow turtle! Rotten orange!

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:31.360
You're not qualified to be a banchou!

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:32.600
You fail!

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:36.690
Well, I certainly don't have what it takes to be a banchou.

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:39.020
If we relieve Fujioka-kun of his position–

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:39.810
Who's going to become the fifth banchou?

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:43.400
Kana-chan, do you want to try?

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:45.660
You're the legendary banchou's sister after all.

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:46.430
You're well-suited.

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:54.810
Since you even agreed to be a banchou, why don't you join the volleyball team, as well? Come on!

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:57.600
I told you I'm not a banchou!

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:58.850
Please, I beg you Minami Haruka!

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:01.870
What are you doing, Hosaka-senpai?
Please, I beg you Minami Haruka!

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:02.620
What do I need to do to be her subordinate?
Please, I beg you Minami Haruka!

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:04.270
What do I need to do to be her subordinate?

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:05.210
I do not know.

00:17:06.030 --> 00:17:08.800
Minami Haruka is going to become a banchou.

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:10.850
And I'm going to become her subordinate.

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:13.990
To serve Minami Haruka with both my body and heart...

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:16.360
To be tested in water and fire!

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:20.060
Why do you have to strip?

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:23.990
Firing torpedo at C5.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:24.790
Fumble.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:28.810
Do you want to try being a banchou?

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:31.030
Attacking A2 with 'Harpoon'.

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:32.070
Fumble.

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.290
What're you saying all of a sudden?

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:36.790
Do you have what it takes to shoulder the burden of a banchou?

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:38.970
Scanning E7 with Sonar.

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:41.680
Damn. That was a close call...

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:44.120
Don't just go deciding the lives of others on your own.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.940
Why should I become a banchou?

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:48.050
Declare depth.

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:49.730
Center.

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:52.720
No, I just feel that you have lots of potential.

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:55.590
Planting water mines at A5.

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:58.220
Launching bombs at F6.

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.220
For what reason? Why?

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:01.540
Fumble.

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:04.470
Haruka will come back as the legendary banchou.

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:08.080
I've decided to support her by becoming a banchou in my middle school.

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:12.530
That's why you should also become a banchou in your elementary school to assist her.

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:18.330
There's no reason for Haruka-neesama to become a banchou.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.920
See? Things are going just as usual.

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.340
You're too naive.

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:34.300
Obviously, the legendary banchou won't readily reveal her true self.

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:40.860
Ah, that's no doubt a part of her legend!

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:46.650
Is there something you need?

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:49.250
Go recruit talented people for our army!

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:50.660
What do you mean?

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:55.570
Well, since I've become banchou,
I thought I'd build up a strong army.

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:57.920
Do your best!

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:02.730
With this, you shall be the general of our troops.

00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:04.820
What? I have to participate too?

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:08.550
So, lend me your wisdom – how should we recruit members?

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:15.180
Then, since you're calling it an army, how about trying to bring in people who are physically strong?

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:16.270
How do we get them?

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:19.500
Well, we can select them through arm-wrestling.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:20.860
Indeed!

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:28.270
We're going to host an arm-wrestling match.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:29.790
It's not an arm-wrestling match.

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:33.280
This is a serious audition for recruiting subordinates.

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:36.420
Whatever is fine. Let's do it!

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:38.170
You don't need to, Yu-chan.

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:39.170
Why?

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:41.750
You're already a member of the army.

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:44.590
Hey, do we get a prize if we win?

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:46.260
You're right.

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:50.940
Then you can have Fujioka! If you win, you can do whatever you want with him.

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:54.600
Let's decide this!

00:19:57.510 --> 00:19:58.720
C'mon!

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:00.690
Riko...

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:09.300
Become a banchou and build an army.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:11.370
This is all for the sake of Haruka!

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:13.490
An army, huh?

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:19.080
Yoshino and Touma would be useful but they're too well-behaved.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:20.950
The chances of them joining are very slim.

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:26.030
On the other hand, Makoto and Uchida can be easily made my underlings, but they're so dumb.

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:30.030
The people Kana can gather are most likely of about the same level.

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:36.850
I'm sorry, Haruka-neesama.

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:39.810
It looks like I'm unable to aid you.

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:46.860
Minami-san.

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:47.770
Yes?

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:51.310
Regarding the matter of selecting a new class rep...

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:55.220
Unfortunately, I think I'll have to refuse...

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:57.500
About that, actually...

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:05.340
You'll be pleased to hear this, Haruka!

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:07.460
Hmm? Did something nice happen?

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.210
It's the Kana Army! Kana Army!

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:13.290
From now on, we'll be adding to your strength, Haruka!

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:14.500
What exactly are you talking about?

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:17.320
That! The Great Banchou!

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:18.190
Hmm?

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:22.040
I mean the thing about the comeback of the legendary banchou Haruka...

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:26.670
The nearby schools will succumb! We'll build the big syndicate that will be known as the Haruka Empire!

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:28.580
There's no way that would happen...

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:34.240
But then, didn't you say something on the phone about accepting or not accepting?

00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:38.410
The class rep matter? That issue's already settled.

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:42.290
The class rep who was sick has recovered and will be back after this week.

00:21:42.770 --> 00:21:43.790
Hey!

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:44.490
What?

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:46.700
Don't "what" me!

00:21:51.840 --> 00:21:53.390
Hurry up, Kana!

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:55.130
It's no time to be eating breakfast!

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:03.570
Are you still thinking about the Kana Army?

00:22:03.570 --> 00:22:05.000
Army?

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:06.540
It's over, it's all over.

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:11.650
The problem is how can I finish breakfast within three minutes.

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:14.190
Banchou!

00:22:15.220 --> 00:22:18.280
What're you yelling? You're the one who's banchou.

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:26.640
Just what should I do...

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:02.840
What time do you like taking your bath at?
At night? Or in the morning?

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:05.200
Actually, taking it at night is good for your health.

00:24:05.200 --> 00:24:08.590
Bathing yourself in water close to body temperature will assist metabolism.

00:24:08.590 --> 00:24:10.050
Plus, it also has the effect of helping you relax.

00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:13.710
If you shower with hot water in the morning, it'll freshen up your whole body.
